41.what is Starvation?
   Starvation is a situation where a thread waits for a long time because other threads continuously get CPU time or access to the required resource, preventing the thread from making progress.

42.What is deamon Thread?
   A daemon thread is a background thread that runs to support other threads. The JVM does not wait for daemon threads to finish. When all non-daemon threads finish, the JVM can terminate even if daemon threads are still running.

